# Week 4 Report — Final Evaluation & Results

## What Was Done

During Week 4, the final version of the deep learning model for scene classification was completed and evaluated.

The dataset was loaded using TensorFlow image dataset utilities with train, validation, and test splits. Transfer learning with MobileNetV2 was used as the main architecture.

Additional data augmentation techniques were applied to improve generalization and reduce overfitting:

* Random horizontal flip
* Random rotation
* Random zoom

The pretrained MobileNetV2 base model was frozen and used as a feature extractor. A custom classification head with dense and dropout layers was added for the final prediction task.

The final model was trained for 5 epochs and evaluated on the test dataset.

