# Model Architecture

```text
Input Image (150×150×3)
→ Data Augmentation
→ Rescaling Layer
→ MobileNetV2 (pretrained on ImageNet)
→ GlobalAveragePooling2D
→ Dropout(0.3)
→ Dense(128, ReLU)
→ Dropout(0.3)
→ Dense(6, Softmax)
```

