# Training Analysis

The training and validation accuracy curves showed stable learning behavior during training.

The model improved significantly compared to the baseline CNN from Week 2. Transfer learning with MobileNetV2 helped extract more powerful visual features from the images.

Dropout layers and data augmentation helped reduce overfitting and improved model generalization.

The validation accuracy remained close to the training accuracy, indicating that the model generalized well to unseen data.

